<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Starlings Hospitality</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f6f2; color: #1b2a4a; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b2a4a 0%, #2d4a7a 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #c49a2d; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-family: Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .body h2 { color: #1b2a4a; margin-top: 0; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; background: #c49a2d; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { background: #f8f6f2; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>✈ Starlings Hospitality</h1>
      <p>Where your travel dreams become reality</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Welcome, {{firstName}}! 🌍</h2>
      <p>We're absolutely thrilled to have you join the Starlings family. Your adventure is just beginning, and we can't wait to help you explore the world.</p>
      <p>From the golden dunes of Dubai to the romantic streets of Paris, the vibrant energy of Lagos to the iconic skyline of New York — we've got your dream destination covered.</p>
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" class="cta">Explore Destinations</a>
      <p>If you have any questions, our team is always here to help. Just reply to this email or visit our contact page.</p>
      <p>Warm regards,<br><strong>The Starlings Hospitality Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© 2024 Starlings Hospitality. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Dubai, UAE | info@starlingshosp.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
